  "body": "Original guess was \"all elements\", but it doesn't apply to `body` (thank heavens). \n\nIt could be that the note in https://drafts.csswg.org/css-backgrounds-3/#the-background-clip applies here:\n\n`Note that the root element has a different background painting area, and thus the ‘background-clip’ property has no effect when specified on it. See “The backgrounds of special elements.”`\n\nNeed to test.\n\ncf. https://www.w3.org/TR/CSS21/propidx.html\ncf. #26 \n",
